  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'What is the marketing mix or "4 Ps" of the marketing framework? Briefly explain each of the "4 Ps" of marketing. (6 marks)', 'The marketing mix is the set of controllable tools a business combines to satisfy its customers. Product: what is sold - quality, variety, packaging, brand (e.g. fresh milk, cheese). Price: what customers pay - cost, competition, discounts. Place: how it reaches customers - distribution channels, outlets, cold chain. Promotion: how customers learn of it - advertising, social media, demonstrations, offers.', null, '[{"point": "Marketing mix: controllable tools a business uses to meet customer needs", "marks": 2}, {"point": "Product, Price, Place, Promotion explained, 1 mark each", "marks": 4}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'subject-specialisation'),
